              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>Please keep in mind that the data in the dashboard is compiled from different data sources, including external providers, on which we rely for input. While we make every effort to ensure that the data quality meets our standards, some data might still not be accurate - up to 2 percent of the cases. However, we hope that this gives you a good overview of your newbies.</run>
