          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4723' id='10' type-v2='text' w='84643' x='14786' y='444'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='15'>Definitions</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-top' value='6' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='6' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#d61f26' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='1777' id='13' type-v2='empty' w='46218' x='3782' y='5167'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='86612' id='14' type-v2='text' w='92430' x='3782' y='6944'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Fields</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#d61f26' italic='true'># Hire Date</run>
              <run>
Expected hire date of the employee

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#d61f26' italic='true'># Entity starter (y/n)?</run>
              <run>
The field shows whether the employee has started in an entity before relocating to Germany

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#d61f26' italic='true'># Possible to Start in Entity (y/n)?</run>
              <run>
The field shows whether the employee&apos;s country of residence is eligible for remote start

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#d61f26' italic='true'># Transfer (y/n)?</run>
              <run>
The field shows whether the employee has transferred from an entity or a new starter in the company

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#d61f26' italic='true'># Visa Appointment Date</run>
              <run>
The date when the appointment has happened

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#d61f26' italic='true'># Visa Effective Date</run>
              <run>
The date when the visa has been issued

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#d61f26' italic='true'># Arrival Date</run>
              <run>
The date of the flight the employee has booked

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#d61f26' italic='true'># Potential Delay</run>
              <run>
Expected delay in the employee&apos;s start date based on the progress of his/her relocation process


</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Calculated Fields</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#d61f26' italic='true'># Status: </run>
              <run>
Status of relocation progress of the employee: 

</run>
              <run fontname='Tableau Bold' italic='true'>Æ </run>
              <run fontname='Tableau Medium' italic='true'>     If the employee has been living outside of Germany:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true'>            Travel Date TBC</run>
              <run>: 
                  If the employee is EU citizen and he/she does not have travel date
</run>
              <run bold='true'>            Good to start</run>
              <run>: 
                  If the employee is EU citizen and his/her travel date has been entered or
                  If the employee is Non-EU citizen, his/her visa effective date and travel date has been entered
</run>
              <run bold='true'>           Visa pending</run>
              <run>:  
                If the employee is Non-EU citizen and  his/her visa appointment date has not been entered
</run>
              <run bold='true'>           Visa issued - Travel Date TBC</run>
              <run>:</run>
              <run bold='true'>Æ </run>
              <run>
                If the employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa appointment date has been entered but travel date has not been entered yet

</run>
              <run fontname='Tableau Medium'>Æ      </run>
              <run fontname='Tableau Medium' italic='true'>If the employee has been living in Germany:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true'>           Good to start</run>
              <run>: 
                  If the employee is EU citizen or
                  If the employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa effective date has been entered
</run>
              <run bold='true'>           Visa Pending</run>
              <run>: 
                  If the employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa effective date has not been entered 

</run>
              <run fontcolor='#d61f26' italic='true'># Progress: </run>
              <run>
Progress of relocation progress of the employee:

</run>
              <run fontname='Tableau Medium' italic='true'>  If the employee has been living outside of Germany:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;       </run>
              <run bold='true'>Progress: 100%</run>
              <run>:  
            If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa effective date and travel date have been entered and they are before hire date </run>
              <run bold='true'>or</run>
              <run>
            If employee is EU citizen and his/her  travel date has been entered and it is before hire date
</run>
              <run bold='true'>       Progress: 80%</run>
              <run>:  
            If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa effective date has been entered and it is 1 week before hire date. Also, his/her travel date has not been entered yet </run>
              <run bold='true'>or</run>
              <run>
            If employee is EU citizen and his/her travel date has not been entered  it is 1 week before hire date
</run>
              <run bold='true'>      Progress: 60%</run>
              <run>:  
           If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa appointment date has been entered and it is 6 weeks before hire date. Also, his/her visa effective date and travel date have not been entered yet
</run>
              <run bold='true'>      Progress: 50%</run>
              <run>:  
          If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa appointment date has been entered and it is 4 weeks before hire date. Also, his/her visa effective date and travel date have not been entered yet
</run>
              <run bold='true'>      Progress: 20%</run>
              <run>:  
          If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa appointment date, visa effective date and travel date are empty and it is 4 weeks before hire date
</run>
              <run bold='true'>      Progress: 0%</run>
              <run>:  
          If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa appointment date, visa effective date and travel date are empty and it is 2 weeks before hire date

</run>
              <run fontname='Tableau Medium' italic='true'>If the employee has been living in Germany:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true'>      Progress: 100%</run>
              <run>:  
            If employee is Non-EU citizen and he/she has not been entered in Relotalent </run>
              <run bold='true'>or</run>
              <run>
            If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa appointment date has been entered and it is before hire date </run>
              <run bold='true'>or</run>
              <run>
            If employee is EU citizen

</run>
              <run bold='true'>     Progress: 50%</run>
              <run>:  
            If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa appointment date has not been entered and it is 2 weeks before hire date
</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3178' id='24' type-v2='text' w='92430' x='3782' y='93556'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1'>Created By: Esra Yener</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>
Please direct all inquiries to the People Analytics JIRA</run>
            </formatted-text>
