                If the employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa appointment date has been entered but travel date has not been entered yet

</run>
                    <run fontname='Tableau Medium'>Æ      </run>
                    <run fontname='Tableau Medium' italic='true'>If the employee has been living in Germany:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true'>           Good to start</run>
                    <run>: 
                  If the employee is EU citizen or
                  If the employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa effective date has been entered
</run>
                    <run bold='true'>           Visa Pending</run>
                    <run>: 
                  If the employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa effective date has not been entered 

</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#d61f26' italic='true'># Progress: </run>
                    <run>
Progress of relocation progress of the employee:

</run>
                    <run fontname='Tableau Medium' italic='true'>  If the employee has been living outside of Germany:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;       </run>
                    <run bold='true'>Progress: 100%</run>
                    <run>:  
            If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa effective date and travel date have been entered and they are before hire date </run>
                    <run bold='true'>or</run>
                    <run>
            If employee is EU citizen and his/her  travel date has been entered and it is before hire date
</run>
                    <run bold='true'>       Progress: 80%</run>
                    <run>:  
            If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa effective date has been entered and it is 1 week before hire date. Also, his/her travel date has not been entered yet </run>
                    <run bold='true'>or</run>
                    <run>
            If employee is EU citizen and his/her travel date has not been entered  it is 1 week before hire date
</run>
                    <run bold='true'>      Progress: 60%</run>
                    <run>:  
           If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa appointment date has been entered and it is 6 weeks before hire date. Also, his/her visa effective date and travel date have not been entered yet
</run>
                    <run bold='true'>      Progress: 50%</run>
                    <run>:  
          If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa appointment date has been entered and it is 4 weeks before hire date. Also, his/her visa effective date and travel date have not been entered yet
</run>
                    <run bold='true'>      Progress: 20%</run>
                    <run>:  
          If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa appointment date, visa effective date and travel date are empty and it is 4 weeks before hire date
</run>
                    <run bold='true'>      Progress: 0%</run>
                    <run>:  
          If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa appointment date, visa effective date and travel date are empty and it is 2 weeks before hire date

</run>
                    <run fontname='Tableau Medium' italic='true'>If the employee has been living in Germany:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true'>      Progress: 100%</run>
                    <run>:  
            If employee is Non-EU citizen and he/she has not been entered in Relotalent </run>
                    <run bold='true'>or</run>
                    <run>
            If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa appointment date has been entered and it is before hire date </run>
                    <run bold='true'>or</run>
                    <run>
            If employee is EU citizen

</run>
                    <run bold='true'>     Progress: 50%</run>
                    <run>:  
            If employee is Non-EU citizen and his/her visa appointment date has not been entered and it is 2 weeks before hire date
</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
